00:00:21.720 --> 00:00:23.660
This is the world of Beyonders.

00:00:23.680 --> 00:00:29.080
By drinking potions, humans are able to attain 
various Beyonder powers,

00:00:29.110 --> 00:00:32.380
and ascend to divinity.

00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:38.680
The 22 Pathways begin 
with the weakest, Sequence 9.

00:00:38.680 --> 00:00:41.200
The lower the Sequence,

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:43.980
the stronger a Beyonder's abilities.

00:00:44.680 --> 00:00:50.500
Strong Beyonders of the higher-level Sequences
can wield powers strong enough to rival gods.

00:00:50.880 --> 00:00:54.180
This path of evolution is called:

00:00:54.640 --> 00:00:57.180
the Path of the Divine.

00:01:28.640 --> 00:01:31.320
Episode 11    The Mastermind

00:01:28.640 --> 00:01:31.320
Your Reflection in the Mirror

00:02:13.110 --> 00:02:14.310
Order.

00:02:14.310 --> 00:02:15.510
Order!

00:02:18.470 --> 00:02:20.060
Ladies and gentlemen.

00:02:20.430 --> 00:02:21.550
Yesterday...

00:02:20.430 --> 00:02:26.150
Council Hall

00:02:21.830 --> 00:02:24.510
Mr. John Maynard, former head 
of Tingen’s New Party,

00:02:24.510 --> 00:02:28.270
suffered a sudden misfortune and
now rests amid the stormy sea.

00:02:29.080 --> 00:02:31.070
It grieves me deeply.

00:02:29.080 --> 00:02:31.400
Dennis
Tingen City' Mayor

00:02:31.910 --> 00:02:33.510
Punish the murderer!

00:02:33.510 --> 00:02:35.110
Arrest Sharon Khoy!

00:02:35.110 --> 00:02:36.750
Hang that woman!

00:02:38.030 --> 00:02:39.350
Hang her!

00:02:39.430 --> 00:02:40.830
Dennis

00:02:40.430 --> 00:02:43.830
Mr. Maynard, unfortunately, 
succumbed to a heart disease.

00:02:43.830 --> 00:02:47.590
Any rumors are an insult 
to the deceased!

00:02:48.870 --> 00:02:50.990
Mary 
Maynard

00:02:52.830 --> 00:02:54.390
All see it clearly.

00:02:54.540 --> 00:02:58.960
Disease, poverty, 
riots, and famine—

00:02:58.960 --> 00:03:00.820
Tingen is being 
plauged by them.

00:03:01.190 --> 00:03:05.190
People are uncertain of the road ahead,
and faith in the future has vanished.

00:03:06.150 --> 00:03:08.070
I hereby promise:

00:03:08.070 --> 00:03:10.910
To unite the New Party 
and the Conservative Party!

00:03:11.070 --> 00:03:13.390
To uphold Mr. Maynard’s legacy!

00:03:13.630 --> 00:03:15.470
To implement the New Deal!

00:03:16.150 --> 00:03:19.070
The New Deal did not pass 
with an absolute majority!

00:03:19.070 --> 00:03:23.350
Forcibly pushing it through would be a blatant 
violation of the Freedoms and Rights Charter!

00:03:23.790 --> 00:03:28.550
I will lead Tingen onto 
a path of light and hope,

00:03:28.870 --> 00:03:31.070
a path of reform and revitalization.

00:03:31.070 --> 00:03:32.270
Oppose the New Deal!

00:03:32.270 --> 00:03:34.830
I will promote the establishment of a new order.

00:03:34.830 --> 00:03:40.270
Let us turn away from chaos,
poverty, crime and violence!

00:03:40.270 --> 00:03:43.430
Let us establish freedom
and a joyful Tingen!

00:03:44.150 --> 00:03:45.910
Break through shackles.

00:03:46.150 --> 00:03:49.710
The former order
shall fade into history!

00:03:51.510 --> 00:03:53.870
The former order
shall fade into history!

00:03:54.030 --> 00:03:56.350
The future
belongs to Tingen!

00:03:56.350 --> 00:03:59.430
The former order
shall fade into history!

00:03:59.430 --> 00:04:02.390
The future
belongs to Tingen!

00:04:11.150 --> 00:04:12.710
Well done.

00:04:12.790 --> 00:04:14.590
This is your reward.

00:04:18.390 --> 00:04:20.310
Take me somewhere.

00:04:20.660 --> 00:04:25.230
I hadn’t thought Maynard’s 
sudden death would affect her so.

00:04:33.030 --> 00:04:34.510
Follow the carriage in front.

00:04:37.430 --> 00:04:39.510
I hope everything goes smoothly 
on the Captain's side.

00:04:46.150 --> 00:04:49.990
Baron Khoy’s 
Manor

00:04:51.950 --> 00:04:54.290
Search for any unusual clues.

00:04:54.470 --> 00:04:56.020
Proceed discreetly.

00:04:57.070 --> 00:04:57.710
Noted.

00:04:57.710 --> 00:04:59.150
Understood, Captain.

00:05:20.230 --> 00:05:21.430
Tris...

00:05:21.430 --> 00:05:23.230
Captain, I’ve found something.

00:05:23.790 --> 00:05:26.630
This jar of powder doesn’t resemble 
any medicinal powder I know.

00:05:26.870 --> 00:05:28.550
It’s made from a mummy.

00:05:28.550 --> 00:05:30.260
A new trend among the nobility.

00:05:30.260 --> 00:05:33.900
I heard it can be brewed into a potion 
that satisfies both men and women.

00:05:35.390 --> 00:05:38.030
M-Mummies can really 
be used like this?

00:06:09.780 --> 00:06:11.010
Lost them.

00:06:17.230 --> 00:06:18.230
Go straight.

00:06:47.040 --> 00:06:48.520
It failed.

00:06:48.630 --> 00:06:50.550
Did Madam Sharon interfere?

00:06:52.950 --> 00:06:55.550
I'm at...
Blackthorn.

00:06:56.510 --> 00:06:58.390
Why would she come here?

00:06:58.830 --> 00:07:03.380
Spirit World:
A unique realm fully overlapping with the real world. 
Ignores the rules of the material world.

00:07:03.380 --> 00:07:06.830
No distinction between directions. 
Past, present, and future converge.

00:07:06.830 --> 00:07:10.300
Like a strange sea formed from 
infinite knowledge, information, and illusions.

00:07:10.300 --> 00:07:14.750
Divination and prophecy mostly rely on this world, 
followed by the prying into the secrets of fate.

00:07:14.750 --> 00:07:17.470
Messenger: A creature of the Spirit World.

00:07:26.830 --> 00:07:28.930
Your Grace.

00:07:32.670 --> 00:07:35.510
This captivating scent is intoxicating.

00:07:35.710 --> 00:07:41.110
Numbness, oppression, 
suffering and despair.

00:07:41.110 --> 00:07:43.710
Marvelous ingredients fit for a Demoness.

00:07:45.150 --> 00:07:48.390
It seems you are 
advancing smoothly.

00:07:48.520 --> 00:07:53.520
Madam Sharon - Assassin Pathway 
Sequence 6 Pleasure - Demoness Sect

00:07:48.830 --> 00:07:51.550
The City Parliament is dominated by men.

00:07:54.190 --> 00:07:55.470
No one...

00:07:55.670 --> 00:07:57.990
 knows men better than us.

00:08:00.390 --> 00:08:01.950
And no one...

00:08:02.110 --> 00:08:04.670
knows women better than us.

00:08:07.150 --> 00:08:09.670
Greedy and lustful vermin.

00:08:09.870 --> 00:08:12.950
They all crave a night of ecstatic pleasure.

00:08:13.150 --> 00:08:16.030
Just a single taste of bliss...

00:08:16.030 --> 00:08:18.310
and there is no turning back.

00:08:18.510 --> 00:08:23.710
Reduced to puppets on the altar
for me to manipulate at will.

00:08:23.710 --> 00:08:28.550
In no more than two days 
I shall offer all of Tingen to You.

00:08:28.870 --> 00:08:30.470
My Lady.

00:08:39.510 --> 00:08:41.710
I admire you, Sharon.

00:08:41.910 --> 00:08:46.510
But an accident like Maynard’s
threatens my infiltration of the kingdom.

00:08:46.830 --> 00:08:48.400
I won’t tolerate this again.

00:08:48.400 --> 00:08:51.470
Saintess of White Demoness Sect

00:08:48.950 --> 00:08:51.470
If you cannot control your lust,

00:08:51.830 --> 00:08:55.870
do not blame me for taking 
you under my skirts again.

00:08:56.190 --> 00:08:58.870
To teach you with care!

00:09:47.550 --> 00:09:49.710
Everything appears normal.

00:09:50.750 --> 00:09:52.630
The captain and the others 
have already checked—

00:10:13.140 --> 00:10:14.230
A hidden compartment!

00:10:17.990 --> 00:10:20.230
Mrs. Sharon's former lover?

00:10:20.550 --> 00:10:24.540
No wait. This person looks
a little like Mrs. Sharon.

00:10:24.680 --> 00:10:25.980
No way!

00:10:25.980 --> 00:10:30.230
Surely she wasn’t affected by the potion
like Instigator Tris was, right?

00:11:50.750 --> 00:11:54.070
My little darling,
so this is where you were.

00:12:25.190 --> 00:12:28.030
One hour ago

00:12:29.670 --> 00:12:33.760
Mrs. Sharon was able to detect my tracking.
I must use a more covert method.

00:12:34.150 --> 00:12:35.950
I remember Madam Daly said...

00:12:36.630 --> 00:12:40.230
"Summoning a messenger
requires praying to oneself.

00:12:40.230 --> 00:12:43.750
No deity is needed,
so it's quite concealed.

00:12:43.750 --> 00:12:47.310
The key to the prayer is: A specific
description of the summoned being.

00:12:47.310 --> 00:12:51.470
Remember: Don't casually change the
specific description of the summoned.

00:12:51.470 --> 00:12:54.230
That way it's easy 
to attract terrifying creatures."

00:12:59.430 --> 00:13:00.590
I...

00:13:00.950 --> 00:13:03.150
I summon in my name.

00:13:03.430 --> 00:13:05.750
The Fool that doesn't belong to this era.

00:13:05.750 --> 00:13:09.070
The mysterious ruler above the gray fog.

00:13:09.070 --> 00:13:12.110
The King of Yellow and Black 
who wields good luck.

00:13:19.310 --> 00:13:21.190
Did the summoning fail?

00:13:21.490 --> 00:13:24.030
Oh, if I'm summoning myself...

00:13:24.030 --> 00:13:27.630
I’d still need to ascend above the gray fog
to respond to the prayer.

00:13:45.670 --> 00:13:47.830
I really did summon myself.

00:13:48.790 --> 00:13:50.870
I’m infused with the gray fog’s power.

00:13:52.910 --> 00:13:56.470
And it seems to carry some of 
the Flaring Sun Charm’s strength too.

00:14:01.470 --> 00:14:03.950
As expected, sunlight 
won’t harm my Spirit Body.

00:14:29.030 --> 00:14:30.510
Demoness Sect?

00:14:30.510 --> 00:14:31.790
Yes, Captain.

00:14:31.950 --> 00:14:36.380
Clown seems to have stronger spiritual perception.
I saw a statue of the Primordial Demoness.

00:14:37.670 --> 00:14:39.350
The Primordial Demoness, again.

00:14:39.710 --> 00:14:43.150
Notify Frye to guard 
Chanis Gate and get Kenley.

00:14:43.270 --> 00:14:46.670
I need to apply for a Sealed Artifact
to restrain the Demoness Sect. 3-0217.

00:15:05.630 --> 00:15:07.430
Application form?

00:15:14.150 --> 00:15:15.510
Enter.

00:15:27.630 --> 00:15:30.030
Ingredients

00:15:28.590 --> 00:15:30.030
Potions

00:16:01.590 --> 00:16:02.990
This is...

00:16:03.190 --> 00:16:05.950
the sealing power 
behind Chanis Gate!

00:16:35.150 --> 00:16:38.630
3-0217: Spirit Medium's Mirror.

00:16:36.990 --> 00:16:42.040 line:20%
Spirit Medium's Mirror - Reflects different images
Each viewer faces different dangers
The greatest danger: Seeing yourself

00:16:38.630 --> 00:16:40.190
Originally owned by a Spirit Medium.

00:16:40.190 --> 00:16:41.600
Never look at it directly.

00:16:41.600 --> 00:16:44.970
It's deadly to Demoness Sect members.

00:16:44.970 --> 00:16:46.750
Shards alone can turn them to dust.

00:16:54.230 --> 00:16:58.150
Remember: never point it 
at yourself or your allies.

00:16:58.150 --> 00:17:00.150
I’ll pull her into a dream 
from a distance.

00:17:00.150 --> 00:17:01.900
Move quickly.

00:17:26.340 --> 00:17:28.410
Nightmare's control 
has grown stronger.

00:17:52.430 --> 00:17:53.380
Seal!

00:18:05.510 --> 00:18:07.070
Too smooth...

00:18:07.950 --> 00:18:10.230
Black Flame.

00:18:10.870 --> 00:18:11.910
A wand substitute?

00:18:23.470 --> 00:18:24.400
Kenley!

00:18:30.470 --> 00:18:32.510
Nightmare didn’t control her.

00:18:32.510 --> 00:18:34.230
It was all an illusion!

00:18:34.910 --> 00:18:38.110
If it weren't for this statue 
being right beside me,

00:18:38.110 --> 00:18:42.470
I would be sleeping,
waiting for you to kiss me awake.

00:18:42.470 --> 00:18:43.910
Die heretic!

00:18:46.030 --> 00:18:46.830
No!

00:19:01.630 --> 00:19:02.350
Kenley!

00:19:03.630 --> 00:19:04.190
Kenley!

00:19:07.470 --> 00:19:09.830
There's a familiar scent...

00:19:10.070 --> 00:19:11.390
Is that you?

00:19:11.390 --> 00:19:16.020
Sneaking into my house this afternoon,
playing tricks like a little mouse, hm?

00:19:16.150 --> 00:19:19.470
Only Sequence 8,
yet you managed to fool me.

00:19:19.470 --> 00:19:22.350
What secret are you hiding?

00:19:22.630 --> 00:19:23.910
Night...

00:19:24.190 --> 00:19:25.310
Slumber!

00:19:51.910 --> 00:19:53.430
Another mirror substitute?

00:20:16.910 --> 00:20:19.070
Insufferable little bug.

00:20:26.990 --> 00:20:28.150
Seal!

00:20:29.590 --> 00:20:30.950
Pleasure!

00:20:33.540 --> 00:20:35.910
Oh? Cannot destroy it?

00:20:41.870 --> 00:20:42.830
That statue!

00:20:52.710 --> 00:20:54.310
Frost!

00:21:13.790 --> 00:21:15.230
Why bother?

00:21:15.790 --> 00:21:17.390
It’s all in vain.

00:21:18.140 --> 00:21:21.110
Listen. Such a beautiful sound.

00:21:22.870 --> 00:21:25.750
The death knell
has already rung!

00:21:27.190 --> 00:21:32.310
This continent will soon return 
to its rightful order!

00:21:34.510 --> 00:21:39.150
Let that order
start with Tingen!

00:21:41.750 --> 00:21:45.150
Come, young Nighthawk.

00:21:45.150 --> 00:21:47.070
Reveal your secret.

00:21:47.190 --> 00:21:50.630
Swear your loyalty
to the Primordial Demoness.

00:21:51.110 --> 00:21:55.630
Know this: only by staying close to me,
close to the Primordial Demoness,

00:21:55.630 --> 00:21:59.790
can you obtain 
blessing and salvation

00:22:00.190 --> 00:22:01.660
and avoid...

00:22:01.660 --> 00:22:03.870
the Apocalypse.

00:22:03.870 --> 00:22:05.190
Sandman!

00:22:12.070 --> 00:22:13.230
Pleasure!

00:22:31.470 --> 00:22:33.150
Captain...

00:22:43.990 --> 00:22:45.550
Very good.

00:22:46.030 --> 00:22:49.910
The last bug is finally here!

00:22:50.510 --> 00:22:52.430
Let's die together!

00:22:56.430 --> 00:22:58.310
Concealment!

00:23:02.350 --> 00:23:03.630
Illusion!

00:23:18.550 --> 00:23:19.870
Blood Curse.

00:23:24.950 --> 00:23:27.470
Night Purification!

00:23:40.470 --> 00:23:41.510
Too fast.

00:23:41.950 --> 00:23:43.260
Impossible to lock on!

00:23:44.670 --> 00:23:46.550
I must predict her moves.

00:23:52.790 --> 00:23:53.950
A chance!

00:24:12.710 --> 00:24:13.310
No!

00:24:13.510 --> 00:24:14.470
No!

00:24:16.790 --> 00:24:17.750
No!

00:24:18.380 --> 00:24:19.790
No!

00:25:04.550 --> 00:25:05.350
It's over.

00:25:38.190 --> 00:25:39.340
Kenley...

00:25:54.590 --> 00:25:55.750
It was I...

00:25:56.350 --> 00:25:57.790
who made the mistake.

00:25:58.150 --> 00:26:00.270
Sharon deceived me.

00:26:00.270 --> 00:26:03.310
I didn’t realize she had
already escaped the dream.

00:26:06.230 --> 00:26:08.190
May the Goddess bless you,

00:26:08.310 --> 00:26:10.470
and grant you true rest.

00:26:11.790 --> 00:26:13.910
May the night be free...

00:26:14.830 --> 00:26:17.110
from threats and madness.

00:26:43.790 --> 00:26:46.550
Captain, I’ve taken care 
of the aftermath downstairs.

00:27:46.370 --> 00:27:51.550
Burn my broken shell to new sight

00:27:51.880 --> 00:27:59.650
To be free in mist to hold a cup of light

00:28:00.220 --> 00:28:03.590
Where are the flames that come in fury?

00:28:03.650 --> 00:28:06.860
Where are the keys that carve truth from me?

00:28:07.110 --> 00:28:12.690
Into the dark to dream and scream my name

00:28:12.710 --> 00:28:15.910
Wonder or dismay

00:28:15.940 --> 00:28:19.570
Madness or decay

00:28:19.790 --> 00:28:21.650
With fragile light

00:28:21.670 --> 00:28:25.740
I vow to guard a world I stay

00:28:26.280 --> 00:28:29.700
Stirring or delay

00:28:29.720 --> 00:28:33.030
Rebirth or be same

00:28:33.630 --> 00:28:38.900
With whispers in gray guide my shadow way

00:28:39.250 --> 00:28:42.810
Fade away